%% TitanFit — Authentication flow
%% register/login -> bcrypt -> JWT access(15m) + refresh(7d)
%% secure storage -> interceptor auto-refresh on 401 -> rotate -> logout revokes refresh.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant APP as Flutter App
    participant STG as flutter_secure_storage
    participant API as Express REST API
    participant AUTH as AuthService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (Prisma)

    Note over U,DB: REGISTER
    U->>APP: submit registration form
    APP->>API: POST /api/auth/register {email, password, name}
    API->>AUTH: validate payload
    AUTH->>AUTH: bcrypt.hash(password, 10)
    AUTH->>DB: create User (email is unique)
    DB-->>AUTH: user row
    API-->>APP: 201 Created

    Note over U,DB: LOGIN
    U->>APP: submit login form
    APP->>API: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
    API->>DB: find User by email
    DB-->>API: stored bcrypt hash
    API->>AUTH: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
    AUTH->>AUTH: verified -> sign JWTs
    API-->>APP: accessToken (TTL 15 min) + refreshToken (TTL 7 days)
    APP->>STG: persist both tokens (secure storage)

    Note over U,STG: AUTHENTICATED REQUESTS + AUTO-REFRESH
    APP->>API: request with Authorization: Bearer accessToken
    alt access token still valid
        API-->>APP: 200 OK
    else access token expired
        API-->>APP: 401 Unauthorized
        APP->>STG: read refreshToken
        APP->>API: POST /api/auth/refresh {refreshToken}
        API->>AUTH: rotate -> issue new access + refresh pair
        AUTH->>DB: update User.refreshToken (invalidate old)
        API-->>APP: new token pair
        APP->>STG: overwrite stored tokens
        APP->>API: retry original request with new accessToken
    end

    Note over U,STG: LOGOUT
    U->>APP: sign out
    APP->>API: POST /api/auth/logout {refreshToken}
    API->>AUTH: revoke refresh token
    AUTH->>DB: clear User.refreshToken
    API-->>APP: 204 No Content
    APP->>STG: clear tokens